    <!-- Round insights (templates; args are pre-formatted by the engine) -->
    <string name="insight_sg_putting_critical">Putting was the biggest hole in your scorecard — you lost %s strokes on the greens. Speed control on long putts is the quickest fix.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_approach_critical">Approach play was your Achilles heel — %s strokes lost into the green. Distance control and iron accuracy need work.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_off_tee_critical">Tee shots were a major problem — %s strokes lost off the tee. Consider trading distance for accuracy on tight holes.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_short_game_critical">Your short game lost you %s strokes. Getting up-and-down more consistently is the fastest way to lower your score.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_putting_strong">The putter was on fire — %s strokes gained on the greens. Your pace control and green reading were excellent.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_approach_strong">Ball striking was excellent — %s strokes gained on approach shots. That kind of iron play creates birdie looks.</string>
    <string name="insight_sg_total_positive">Overall you gained %s strokes vs your baseline — a genuinely strong all-around performance.</string>
    <string name="insight_fir_low_gir">Hit %1$s%% of fairways but only %2$s%% of greens — your driving sets up good positions but the irons aren\'t converting.</string>
    <string name="insight_low_fir_high_gir">Only %1$s%% fairways but %2$s%% GIR — impressive recovery iron play. Cleaning up tee shots would make you even more dangerous.</string>
    <string name="insight_three_putts_critical">%s three-putts — each one is a stroke wasted. Getting the first putt within 3 feet eliminates the damage.</string>
    <string name="insight_three_putts_warning">%s three-putts today. Lag putting distance control from long range needs attention.</string>
    <string name="insight_good_scrambling">Only %1$s%% GIR but scrambled %2$s%% — your short game saved several strokes and kept the score respectable.</string>
    <string name="insight_poor_scrambling">Missed %1$s%% of greens and only scrambled %2$s%% — short game is costing you 4-5 strokes per round.</string>
    <string name="insight_front_back_worse">Front %1$s, back %2$s — a %3$s shot drop-off. Fatigue or concentration may be fading late.</string>
    <string name="insight_front_back_better">Strong finish — improved %1$s shots from front (%2$s) to back (%3$s).</string>
    <string name="insight_par3_struggles">Par 3s averaged +%s over par — iron accuracy from the tee needs attention on short holes.</string>
    <string name="insight_par5_scoring">Par 5s averaged +%s — not capitalizing on scoring holes. Better course management could unlock birdies.</string>
    <string name="insight_par5_birdie_machine">Par 5s are your scoring holes — averaging %s today. Your length and course management there is a real strength.</string>
    <string name="insight_consecutive_bogeys">%s bogeys in a row — bad streaks often snowball from one poor shot. A reset routine between holes is key.</string>
    <string name="insight_hr_late_round">HR climbed %s bpm from front to back nine — fatigue or pressure may have been a factor in the later holes.</string>
    <string name="insight_worst_club">Your %1$s was your weakest club — avg SG %2$s over %3$s shots. Targeted practice with this club would pay dividends.</string>
    <string name="insight_best_club">Your %1$s was dialed in — %2$s avg SG over %3$s shots. That\'s a club you can trust under pressure.</string>
    <string name="insight_driver_inconsistent">Driver distance was all over the place (±%s yds) — focus on center contact over maximum distance for more consistency.</string>
    <string name="insight_one_putts_high">%s one-putts today — you were holing out from close range consistently. That\'s a real scoring asset.</string>
    <string name="insight_zero_three_putts">Zero three-putts — lag putting distance control was excellent. Great green reading and pace judgment.</string>
    <string name="insight_longest_drive">Longest drive: %s yards — great power off the tee.</string>
    <string name="insight_driver_down_vs_history">Avg driver distance was ~%s yards shorter than your recent average. Check if fatigue or swing changes are affecting your power.</string>
    <string name="insight_driver_up_vs_history">Avg driver distance was ~%s yards longer than your recent average — you were swinging well today.</string>
    <string name="insight_approach_worse_vs_history">Approaches averaged ~%s yards farther from the pin than your recent average — irons weren\'t as sharp today.</string>
    <string name="insight_approach_better_vs_history">Approaches averaged ~%s yards closer to the pin than your recent average — irons were dialed in today.</string>
    <string name="insight_round_duration_long">The round took %s minutes — mental fatigue over 4+ hours can affect decision-making on the back nine.</string>

